# {{componentName}} frontend

Next.js 16 App Router starter generated by ProvisionHub. Requires Node.js 20.9+
and npm. From this `frontend` directory:

```sh
npm install
npm run dev
npm run build
npm run start
```

Open <http://localhost:3000/>. `npm run start` serves the production build.
Use `PORT` to choose another port. Run `npm run lint` to check source with ESLint.
The frontend and backend are separate applications; no API connection is set up.

ProvisionHub generates files only. Install dependencies yourself after generation.
Direct dependencies are pinned, but transitive versions are resolved by npm during
installation. Commit the generated `package-lock.json` and use `npm ci` for
subsequent reproducible installs. No lockfile is distributed with this plugin.
